		(uuid "5cd09493-4564-5ef9-af42-6e2c3a6ea80c")
	)
	(text "-  The fuse value printed in the plug tip.\n-  Whether the car's outlet stays live with the car fully off.\n-  Continuity from plug P1 through cable W1 to the supply junctions.\n-  The button terminal routing and which wire it breaks (+ assumed in this drawing).\n-  The return route of the Qi pad's - wire, and of the USB socket's - tab.\n-  Whether the red and black wires in one connector (IMG_3422) share a circuit.\n-  What the small black cylinder with holes is, on a cable beside the slot bar (3502)."
