	(text "I designed the panel in 3D and\nplanned its circuit before fabrication.\nThen I cut, covered and wired it.\nPhotos document the completed panel\nand help verify this illustration.\n\nThis is a present-day explanatory\ndrawing of the completed panel.\nUse it with the physical photographs.\nDashed lines mark connections hidden\nin the evidence; values approximate.\nParts without library symbols are\nshown as labelled boxes."
